<title>HONG KONG: Shenyin Wanguo final net HK$22.01 mln.</title>
<headline>Shenyin Wanguo final net HK$22.01 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 6.60   vs 6.09</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs 1.57 loss</p>
<p>    Net			  22.01  vs 20.30</p>
<p>    Turnover		   464.42 vs 389.57</p>
<p>    Company name	     Shenyin Wanguo (H.K.) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		May 26-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Shenyin Wanguo was formerly Shanghai International (HK) Ltd, is a property investment, share custodian and financial services company.</p>
<p>The company has changed its financial year end date to December 31 from June 30. Comparative figures are for the 12-months from July 1, 1995 to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
